Description: Native Qt6/QML NVIDIA driver manager and cooling suite
 ro-Control provides an integrated, modern Qt6 desktop interface and
 headless CLI daemon for NVIDIA driver lifecycle management, hardware
 telemetry monitoring, and multi-fan cooling control.
